# MT7925 System Hang - MLO Roaming Issue
# Date: 2026-01-11 18:19:26 PST
# Kernel: 6.18.4-2-cachyos-wifi-fix (with 3 of 18 patches applied)
# System: ASUS laptop with AMD Ryzen AI 300 series + RTX 5070

## Summary
System hung during WiFi roaming/authentication. Hard reboot required.
Logs stop abruptly at 18:19:34 - no kernel panic captured (silent hang/deadlock).

## Root Cause
MLO (Multi-Link Operation / WiFi 7) authentication failure during roaming.
The kernel was missing patches 0012-0018 which address MLO-related issues.

## Last WiFi Activity Before Hang
Jan 11 18:19:26 wpa_supplicant[1367]: wlan0: SME: Trying to authenticate with d8:b3:70:f8:89:52 (SSID='Pfizer 5G Implant' freq=6135 MHz)
Jan 11 18:19:26 wpa_supplicant[1367]: nl80211: kernel reports: link ID must for MLO group key

